2. In these Regulations, unless the context otherwise requires —
“Board” means the Appeal Advisory Board established under section 92 of the Act;
[S 491/2023 wef 31/12/2021]
“Chairperson” means the Chairperson of the Board appointed under section 92(1) of the Act;
[S 491/2023 wef 31/12/2021]
“member” means a member of the Board appointed under section 92(1) of the Act;
[S 491/2023 wef 31/12/2021]
“Vice-Chairperson” means the Vice-Chairperson of the Board appointed under section 92(1) of the Act.
[S 491/2023 wef 31/12/2021]
